<resources>
    <string name="mg_help_title">Mini Golf</string>
    <string name="mg_help_text">Drag back from the ball like a slingshot and let go to putt: the farther you drag, the harder the putt. You can also use the aim buttons, the power slider and Putt. Sand slows the ball, water costs a penalty stroke and sends the ball back, belts push it and bumpers bounce it. The fewest strokes wins, and a hole ends at the stroke limit.</string>
